>>
Rule 1 (x must be a floating-point tensor dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 2 (x cannot have bool, integer, or complex dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 2 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 3 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 4 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 5 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor shape dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
